    // But original shape is [7,7,3], so transposing with [1,0,2] swaps first two dims
    // Wait, original shape: [in_channels, out_channels, kernel_size]
    // We need shape: [out_channels, in_channels, kernel_size]
    // So permutation: [1, 0, 2]
